## QA

- Wide Edit Task modal: no Project dropdown. One row: color icon, State, Priority, Start, Due, Hours, Assigned to. State, Priority, and Hours are visibly narrower. Nothing wraps onto a second field line.
- Color popover still sets and clears color; hex shows on hover.
- Phase and Plans sit left of Add tag. Tags still add and remove on the right. A task with no project shows no Phase. A child task shows Inherited from parent and a disabled Phase.
- Links and Depends on / Required by open collapsed with counts, expand to the current lists, and collapse again. Adding a dependency works while expanded. Idea and document link panels stay open.
- List and project-board **Move to…** still changes project. Reopening the task shows the new project’s phases.
- Narrow viewport: the field row wraps without overlap. Delete still asks for confirmation.

